  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "量子計算與量子晶片設計",
    "sub_ename": "QUANTUM COMPUTING AND QUANTUM CHIP DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹學生量子計算之基礎知識與重要概念並導入初級量子晶片設計，以培養學生在量子計算相關產業發展的基礎與進階研發能力。課程內容包含(一)量子力學簡介：介紹量子疊加、相干、糾纏、演化、以及量子測量。(二)量子算法：介紹量子演算法基本概念並探討其與古典計算的異同。(三)量子電腦硬體簡介：介紹主流量子電腦硬體架構與工程設計考量。(四)初級微波量子晶片設計：介紹微波量子晶片電路架構、晶片的電路設計與電磁模擬、模擬結果的分析與量子模型的萃取、以及量子閘的最佳化。在本課程中學生將有機會練習微波電路之量子模型的萃取，以增進對設計概念的理解。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to provide students with foundational knowledge and key concepts of quantum computing, while introducing elementary quantum chip design. The goal is to cultivate both basic and advanced research and development skills applicable to the quantum computing industry. The course content includes: (1) Introduction to Quantum Mechanics: Quantum superposition, interference, entanglement, evolution, and quantum measurement. (2) Quantum Algorithms: Basic concepts of quantum algorithms and their differences and similarities with classical computation. (3) Overview of Quantum Computer Hardware: Architecture of mainstream quantum computer hardware and considerations for engineering design. (4) Elementary Microwave Quantum Chip Design: Circuit architecture of microwave quantum chips, circuit design, electromagnetic simulation, analysis of simulation results, quantum model extraction, and optimization of quantum gates.\nDuring the course, students will have the opportunity to practice quantum model extraction for microwave circuits, enhancing their understanding of design concepts.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
